{"seq":2,"slug":"claim-substantiation-evidence","title":"宣称依据/实证留存","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketing-claim-promo-compliance/claim-governance-risk/claim-substantiation-evidence","wordCount":2055,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"宣称依据-实证留存\">宣称依据/实证留存</h1><p>「我们做过研究」这句话在监管问询面前没有价值。有价值的是：一份可核验的材料、它取得的<strong>时间早于传播</strong>、它覆盖的范围与宣称的每一个限定词对得上、以及它自取得以来没有被替换过。这四项构成证据的完整形态，缺任何一项都会让宣称回到「无依据」的状态。</p>\n<p>这一篇讲怎么把这四项做成系统的数据能力。前两章已经定义了各类宣称需要什么级别的证据（<a href=\"../advertising-claim-rule/efficacy-health-finance-claim\">功效/健康/金融宣称限制</a>、<a href=\"../advertising-claim-rule/comparative-advertising-condition\">比较广告的合法条件</a>、<a href=\"../advertising-claim-rule/green-claim-greenwashing\">绿色/环保宣称与反洗白</a>）；本篇处理证据本身的存储、关联、时间证明与留存期。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>证据系统的难点不在存文件，而在<strong>关联</strong>。一份检测报告可以被十条宣称引用，一条宣称可能需要三份材料共同支撑（例如比较广告需要自家侧与竞品侧各一份），而其中一份材料的版本升级会影响到所有引用它的宣称。这要求证据与宣称之间是多对多关系，且关系本身带元数据（引用的是材料整体还是某一页、引用的截止版本）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[宣称 claim] --&gt; B[宣称-证据关联&lt;br/&gt;claim_evidence_link]&#10;  B --&gt; C[证据材料 evidence_document]&#10;  C --&gt; D[来源类型: 检测/试验/证书/快照]&#10;  C --&gt; E[取得时间 obtained_at]&#10;  C --&gt; F[内容哈希 document_hash]&#10;  C --&gt; G[覆盖范围 scope]&#10;  B --&gt; H[引用粒度&lt;br/&gt;整篇/章节/页码]&#10;  C --&gt; I[留存期 retention_until]&#10;  C --&gt; J[防篡改锚定&lt;br/&gt;trusted_timestamp]\">graph TD\n  A[宣称 claim] --&gt; B[宣称-证据关联&lt;br/&gt;claim_evidence_link]\n  B --&gt; C[证据材料 evidence_document]\n  C --&gt; D[来源类型: 检测/试验/证书/快照]\n  C --&gt; E[取得时间 obtained_at]\n  C --&gt; F[内容哈希 document_hash]\n  C --&gt; G[覆盖范围 scope]\n  B --&gt; H[引用粒度&lt;br/&gt;整篇/章节/页码]\n  C --&gt; I[留存期 retention_until]\n  C --&gt; J[防篡改锚定&lt;br/&gt;trusted_timestamp]</pre><h3 id=\"证据的分级与覆盖范围\">证据的分级与覆盖范围</h3><p>前面两章已经建立了分级：人体随机对照试验的强度最高，人体观察性研究次之，动物与体外研究更次，消费者证言与个人经验调查在健康宣称上永不充分。分级是一个标量，便于比较；但真正决定判定的是<strong>覆盖范围</strong>，它是一个结构化对象。一份 RCT 是证据强度 5，但如果它测的是另一个配方、另一个剂量、另一个人群，它对当前宣称的支撑力是零。</p>\n<p>所以每条证据记录都必须带四个覆盖字段：产品、剂量/规格、配方版本、受试人群。宣称引用证据时，判定器检查这四个字段与宣称声明的字段是否匹配。这个设计把「用产品 A 的研究支撑产品 B」这个最常见的违规形态变成了一个机械的字段比对，不需要语义判断。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>覆盖字段</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>不匹配的后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>covers_product</code></td>\n<td>实验对象的商品标识</td>\n<td>支撑力为零，判定为未匹配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>covers_dosage</code></td>\n<td>剂量或规格</td>\n<td>高剂量实验不能支撑低剂量产品</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>covers_formulation</code></td>\n<td>配方版本</td>\n<td>配方改版后旧证据失效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>covers_population</code></td>\n<td>受试人群</td>\n<td>健康人群研究不支撑患病人群宣称</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>method_summary</code></td>\n<td>方法与标准</td>\n<td>比较广告要求两侧方法说明匹配</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"时间证明\">时间证明</h3><p>「传播前已持有」这一条最难做，因为它需要证明一件事发生在过去，而系统记录是自证的。可用的做法有两层，按强度递增。</p>\n<p>美国联邦贸易委员会的政策声明把这一点确立为广告实证的底层要求：广告主与广告代理机构在广告传播<strong>之前</strong>就必须对广告宣称持有合理依据（<a href=\"https://www.ftc.gov/legal-library/browse/ftc-policy-statement-regarding-advertising-substantiation\">FTC Policy Statement Regarding Advertising Substantiation</a>）。第一层是<strong>单调写入日志</strong>：证据入库时写入一条带服务器时间戳的记录，并把入库记录设计成只追加不修改。这能证明「系统在 T 时刻记过这份材料」，但无法独立证明材料内容在 T 时刻就是现在这样。</p>\n<p>第二层是<strong>可信时间戳锚定</strong>：对材料内容取哈希，把哈希提交到外部可信时间源（RFC 3161 时间戳服务，或把哈希写入一个公开的、按时间顺序增长的账本），取得一个可第三方验证的「该哈希在 T 时刻已存在」的证明。这一层能同时证明内容与时间，因为事后改内容会改变哈希。</p>\n<p>两层不是替代关系：第一层是日常记录，第二层对高风险宣称（健康、金融、环保的强断言）强制执行。判定时若某条高风险宣称的证据缺第二层锚定，即使级别达标也应进复核队列——这不是法律要求的形式主义，而是在争议中能否被采信的分水岭。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE evidence_document (&#10;  id                 BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  source_kind        TEXT   NOT NULL,&#10;  evidence_level     TEXT   NOT NULL,&#10;  method_summary     TEXT   NOT NULL,&#10;  covers_product     TEXT   NOT NULL,&#10;  covers_dosage      TEXT,&#10;  covers_formulation TEXT,&#10;  covers_population  TEXT,&#10;  obtained_at        TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  recorded_at        TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  valid_until        TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  document_uri       TEXT   NOT NULL,&#10;  document_hash      TEXT   NOT NULL,&#10;  ts_anchor          JSONB,&#10;  retention_until    TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  status             TEXT   NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;active&#39;,&#10;  UNIQUE (document_hash, obtained_at)&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_evidence_scope&#10;  ON evidence_document (covers_product, status, valid_until);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> evidence_document</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  id                 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  source_kind        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  evidence_level     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  method_summary     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  covers_product     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  covers_dosage      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  covers_formulation </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  covers_population  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  obtained_at        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  recorded_at        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  valid_until        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  document_uri       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  document_hash      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ts_anchor          JSONB,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  retention_until    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">             TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'active'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (document_hash, obtained_at)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_evidence_scope</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> evidence_document (covers_product, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, valid_until);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>ts_anchor</code> 存的是外部时间戳证明（服务标识、序列号、令牌）；<code>status</code> 支持把材料标记为失效（例如证书过期、实验结果被后续研究推翻），但<strong>不删除</strong>——失效的证据在历史判定中仍需要被引用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与宣称的关联\">与宣称的关联</h2><p>关联表承载引用粒度与引用时的判定结论：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE claim_evidence_link (&#10;  claim_id     BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;  evidence_id  BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;  cited_scope  TEXT   NOT NULL,&#10;  cited_at     TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  satisfies    BOOLEAN NOT NULL,&#10;  check_note   TEXT,&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (claim_id, evidence_id, cited_scope)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> claim_evidence_link</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  claim_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  evidence_id  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  cited_scope  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  cited_at     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  satisfies    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BOOLEAN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  check_note   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (claim_id, evidence_id, cited_scope)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>satisfies</code> 记录关联建立时的判定结论，<code>check_note</code> 记录不匹配的具体字段。这个设计让「这条宣称现在为什么是无依据状态」可以一次查询回答：找出所有 <code>satisfies = false</code> 的关联，看 <code>check_note</code> 里缺的是哪个覆盖字段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"留存期与删除\">留存期与删除</h2><p>留存期有三个约束同时作用，取最长者：<strong>法定留存要求</strong>（各市场不同，部分市场对广告相关材料有明确年限）、<strong>诉讼时效</strong>（争议可能在违法行为发生数年后才被提起）、以及<strong>内部审计要求</strong>。工程上的做法是给每条证据算一个 <code>retention_until</code>，由规则驱动而不是人工设定。</p>\n<p>删除策略必须与留存区分：<strong>到期后默认仍不物理删除，而是转入冷存储并保留哈希与元数据</strong>。理由是删除材料会让历史判定无法复现——而历史判定的可复现性正是第三章规则快照要解决的问题。物理删除只应在有明确要求（例如涉及个人数据的删除请求）时执行，且执行后必须在证据记录上留下「已因 X 原因删除、哈希为 H」的痕迹，这样至少能证明材料存在过。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"retention_policy:&#10;  evidence_kinds:&#10;    human_clinical_trial:&#10;      basis: [litigation_limitation, internal_audit]&#10;      min_years: 10&#10;      post_expiry: cold_storage_keep_hash&#10;    third_party_test_report:&#10;      basis: [litigation_limitation]&#10;      min_years: 6&#10;      post_expiry: cold_storage_keep_hash&#10;    price_snapshot:&#10;      basis: [regulatory_display_log, litigation_limitation]&#10;      min_years: 5&#10;      post_expiry: cold_storage_keep_hash&#10;    certification:&#10;      basis: [validity_period, litigation_limitation]&#10;      min_years: 5&#10;      post_expiry: cold_storage_keep_hash&#10;  physical_delete:&#10;    allowed_only_when: [data_subject_request, court_order]&#10;    require_tombstone: true\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">retention_policy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  evidence_kinds</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    human_clinical_trial</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      basis</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">litigation_limitation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">internal_audit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      min_years</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      post_expiry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">cold_storage_keep_hash</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    third_party_test_report</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      basis</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">litigation_limitation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      min_years</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      post_expiry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">cold_storage_keep_hash</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    price_snapshot</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      basis</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">regulatory_display_log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">litigation_limitation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      min_years</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      post_expiry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">cold_storage_keep_hash</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    certification</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      basis</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">validity_period</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">litigation_limitation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      min_years</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      post_expiry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">cold_storage_keep_hash</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  physical_delete</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    allowed_only_when</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">data_subject_request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">court_order</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    require_tombstone</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"证据的失效与宣称的下架联动\">证据的失效与宣称的下架联动</h3><p>一个容易被漏掉的运维场景：证据失效（证书过期、配方改版导致旧实验结果不再适用、研究被后续证据推翻）时，依赖它的宣称必须被同步处置。这不是可选的清理工作——继续用失效证据支撑的宣称就是无依据宣称。</p>\n<p>可行的做法是把失效做成一个事件：证据状态变更触发一次反向查询，找出所有 <code>satisfies = true</code> 的关联，把这些宣称对应的素材标记为待复核并通知责任方。链路是「证据状态变更 → 关联查询 → 素材标待复核 → 闸门在下次判定时阻断」，最后一步由发布闸执行（见 <a href=\"../claim-rule-engine-gate/campaign-prepublish-gate\">活动/素材发布前合规闸</a> 的判定有效期设计）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>证据的完整形态是四项：材料可核验、取得时间早于传播、覆盖范围与宣称的限定词对得上、自取得以来未被替换。缺任何一项宣称即回到无依据状态。</li>\n<li>关联是证据系统的难点：证据与宣称是多对多，关系本身带引用粒度；一条宣称可能需要多份材料共同支撑（比较广告需两侧各一份）。</li>\n<li>覆盖范围比证据级别更决定判定：产品、剂量、配方版本、受试人群四个字段的机械比对，能把「用产品 A 的研究支撑产品 B」这类违规变成字段不匹配而无需语义判断。</li>\n<li>时间证明分两层：单调写入日志证明系统在 T 时刻记录过，外部可信时间戳锚定（RFC 3161 或按序账本）同时证明内容与时间。高风险宣称强制要求第二层。</li>\n<li>留存期取法定要求、诉讼时效、内部审计三者最长者；到期默认转冷存储并保留哈希与元数据，物理删除仅在有明确要求时执行且必须留下墓碑记录。</li>\n<li>证据失效必须触发联动：反向查询受影响的宣称、把素材标记待复核、由发布闸在下次判定时阻断。失效但不删除，历史判定仍需引用。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"宣称依据/实证留存","id":"宣称依据-实证留存"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"证据的分级与覆盖范围","id":"证据的分级与覆盖范围"},{"level":3,"text":"时间证明","id":"时间证明"},{"level":2,"text":"与宣称的关联","id":"与宣称的关联"},{"level":2,"text":"留存期与删除","id":"留存期与删除"},{"level":3,"text":"证据的失效与宣称的下架联动","id":"证据的失效与宣称的下架联动"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"虚假宣传处罚与整改","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketing-claim-promo-compliance/claim-governance-risk/false-publicity-penalty"},"next":{"title":"促销合规监控与巡检","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketing-claim-promo-compliance/claim-governance-risk/promo-compliance-monitor"}}